# Cotton Connection — Complete Website Plan

A luxury online store for towels (face, hand, body), bathrobes, bed sheets, and pillow covers. The website should feel **luxurious, cozy, and modern**, targeting customers who value comfort and style.

---

## 1. Design System

### Color Palette

| Token | Hex | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| `--color-cream` | `#FAF7F2` | Page background |
| `--color-linen` | `#F0EBE3` | Card backgrounds, alt sections |
| `--color-blush` | `#F2D7D5` | Soft accent, hover states |
| `--color-warm-grey` | `#B8AFA9` | Borders, muted text |
| `--color-charcoal` | `#2C2C2C` | Primary text |
| `--color-deep-charcoal` | `#1A1A1A` | Footer background, bold headings |
| `--color-teal` | `#5B8A8A` | Primary accent (buttons, links, highlights) |
| `--color-teal-dark` | `#3D6B6B` | Button hover, active states |
| `--color-gold` | `#C9A96E` | Luxury accent (badges, stars, dividers) |
| `--color-gold-light` | `#D4B98A` | Gold hover / subtle highlight |
| `--color-white` | `#FFFFFF` | Pure white for cards, modals |
| `--color-soft-pink` | `#E8D5D0` | Newsletter section background |

### Typography

| Element | Font | Weight | Size (Desktop) | Size (Mobile) | Line Height | Letter Spacing |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| H1 (Hero) | **Playfair Display** (serif) | 700 | 56px | 36px | 1.15 | -0.02em |
| H2 (Section Title) | **Playfair Display** (serif) | 600 | 40px | 28px | 1.2 | -0.01em |
| H3 (Product/Card Title) | **Playfair Display** (serif) | 600 | 26px | 22px | 1.3 | 0 |
| Body | **Inter** (sans-serif) | 400 | 17px | 16px | 1.7 | 0.01em |
| Body Small | **Inter** (sans-serif) | 400 | 14px | 13px | 1.6 | 0.02em |
| CTA Button | **Inter** (sans-serif) | 600 | 16px | 15px | 1 | 0.08em |
| Nav Links | **Inter** (sans-serif) | 500 | 15px | 14px | 1 | 0.04em |
| Price | **Inter** (sans-serif) | 600 | 20px | 18px | 1 | 0 |
| Badge / Label | **Inter** (sans-serif) | 600 | 12px | 11px | 1 | 0.1em |

> [!TIP]
> Google Fonts import: `Playfair+Display:wght@400;600;700` and `Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700`

### Spacing Scale

| Token | Value | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| `--space-xs` | 4px | Icon gaps |
| `--space-sm` | 8px | Inner padding |
| `--space-md` | 16px | Card padding, element gaps |
| `--space-lg` | 32px | Section inner padding |
| `--space-xl` | 64px | Section vertical padding |
| `--space-2xl` | 96px | Hero vertical padding |
| `--space-3xl` | 128px | Major section separators |

### Border Radius

| Token | Value |
|---|---|
| `--radius-sm` | 4px |
| `--radius-md` | 8px |
| `--radius-lg` | 16px |
| `--radius-pill` | 50px |
| `--radius-round` | 50% |

### Shadows

| Token | Value | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| `--shadow-sm` | `0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.06)` | Subtle card rest |
| `--shadow-md` | `0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08)` | Card hover |
| `--shadow-lg` | `0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.12)` | Modal, featured card |
| `--shadow-gold` | `0 4px 20px rgba(201,169,110,0.15)` | Luxury highlight |

