## 2. Website Sections

---

### 2.1 Navigation Bar

**Purpose:** Brand identity, primary navigation, cart access.

**Layout:**
```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  LOGO          Home  Shop  Collections  About     🛒   │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

- Fixed/sticky on scroll with `backdrop-filter: blur(12px)` and semi-transparent `--color-cream` background
- Logo: brand wordmark in Playfair Display, gold accent on hover
- Desktop: horizontal links, right-aligned cart icon with badge
- Mobile: hamburger menu → slide-in drawer from right

**Animations:**
- Navbar shrinks slightly on scroll (80px → 64px height)
- Links: underline slides in from left on hover (gold `--color-gold`)
- Cart badge: subtle scale bounce when item added

**UI Elements:**
- Logo (text or SVG)
- Nav links with hover underline
- Cart icon with item count badge
- Mobile hamburger button → slide-in menu

---

### 2.2 Hero Section

**Purpose:** Instant emotional impact. Communicate luxury, comfort, and quality. Drive first click.

**Layout:**
```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                                                         │
│              [Full-width background image]               │
│                                                         │
│              "Wrap Yourself in Luxury"                   │
│              Subtitle text line here                     │
│              [ Shop Now ]   [ Explore ]                  │
│                                                         │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

- Full viewport width, 90vh height (desktop), 70vh (mobile)
- Text centered vertically and horizontally
- Semi-transparent dark overlay on image (`rgba(26,26,26,0.35)`)
- Text color: `--color-white`

**Animations:**
| Element | Animation | Duration | Delay |
|---|---|---|---|
| Background image | Subtle parallax (moves at 0.5x scroll speed) | Continuous | — |
| Background image | Ken Burns slow zoom (scale 1.0 → 1.08) | 20s | 0s |
| H1 heading | Fade up (translateY 30px → 0, opacity 0 → 1) | 1s | 0.3s |
| Subtitle | Fade up | 1s | 0.6s |
| CTA buttons | Fade up + slight scale (0.95 → 1) | 0.8s | 0.9s |
| Decorative line | Width grows from 0 → 60px | 0.6s | 1.2s |

**Typography:**
- H1: Playfair Display, 56px, weight 700, white, text-shadow
- Subtitle: Inter, 18px, weight 300, white with 85% opacity
- CTA: Inter, 16px, weight 600, uppercase, letter-spacing 0.08em

**Color Details:**
- Background overlay: linear-gradient `rgba(26,26,26,0.2)` to `rgba(26,26,26,0.5)` (top to bottom)
- Primary CTA: `--color-teal` background, white text → hover: `--color-teal-dark`
- Secondary CTA: transparent, white border → hover: white bg, charcoal text

**AI Image Prompt:**
```
A luxurious king-size bed with crisp white cotton bed sheets and plush 
pillows arranged artfully. A folded soft ivory bathrobe draped over the 
corner. Warm ambient lighting from a bedside lamp casting golden tones. 
Modern minimalist bedroom with neutral cream walls and light wood 
furniture. Soft morning light streaming through sheer curtains. Shot 
from elevated angle. Ultra high resolution, 16:9 aspect ratio, 
editorial photography style, depth of field with foreground slightly 
blurred. Color palette: warm creams, whites, soft gold tones.
```

---

### 2.3 Featured Products

**Purpose:** Showcase bestsellers / new arrivals. Drive product discovery and clicks.

**Layout:**
```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                  ✦ Featured Products ✦                   │
│              "Handpicked for Your Comfort"               │
│                                                         │
│  ┌──────────┐  ┌──────────┐  ┌──────────┐  ┌──────────┐│
│  │  [IMAGE] │  │  [IMAGE] │  │  [IMAGE] │  │  [IMAGE] ││
│  │  Title   │  │  Title   │  │  Title   │  │  Title   ││
│  │  Price   │  │  Price   │  │  Price   │  │  Price   ││
│  │ [Add]    │  │ [Add]    │  │ [Add]    │  │ [Add]    ││
│  └──────────┘  └──────────┘  └──────────┘  └──────────┘│
│                                                         │
│                  [ View All Products ]                   │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

- **Desktop:** 4-column CSS Grid, `gap: 24px`, max-width 1200px centered
- **Tablet:** 2-column grid
- **Mobile:** 1-column (or horizontal scroll carousel)
- Section background: `--color-cream`
- Section padding: `96px 0`

**Product Card Anatomy:**
```
┌──────────────────────┐
│                      │  ← Image (aspect-ratio: 4/5, object-fit: cover)
│       [IMAGE]        │  ← "NEW" badge top-left (gold bg)
│                      │  ← Quick-view icon appears on hover (center)
├──────────────────────┤
│  Egyptian Cotton     │  ← H3: Playfair Display, 22px
│  Bath Towel Set      │
│  ★★★★★ (24)         │  ← Stars in gold, count in warm-grey
│  $49.99              │  ← Price: Inter 600, 20px, charcoal
│  [ Add to Cart ]     │  ← Teal button, full-width
└──────────────────────┘
```

**Animations:**
| Element | Trigger | Animation |
|---|---|---|
| Section title | Scroll into view | Fade up, 0.8s |
| Product cards | Scroll into view | Staggered fade up (0.15s delay between cards) |
| Card | Hover | `translateY(-6px)`, shadow `sm → md`, 0.3s ease |
| Card image | Hover | `scale(1.05)`, 0.4s ease (overflow hidden on container) |
| "Add to Cart" button | Rest | Teal bg, white text |
| "Add to Cart" button | Hover | Darken bg (`--color-teal-dark`), slight scale(1.02) |
| Quick-view icon | Hover on card | Fade in at center of image |
| "NEW" badge | — | Subtle pulse animation (scale 1 → 1.05 → 1, 2s infinite) |

