### 2.4 Collections / Categories

**Purpose:** Enable browsing by product type. Visual category navigation.

**Layout:**
```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                   Our Collections                        │
│            "Curated for Every Room"                      │
│                                                         │
│  ◄ ┌────────────┐ ┌────────────┐ ┌────────────┐ ┌────► │
│    │            │ │            │ │            │ │       │
│    │  [IMAGE]   │ │  [IMAGE]   │ │  [IMAGE]   │ │       │
│    │            │ │            │ │            │ │       │
│    │  Towels    │ │ Bathrobes  │ │ Bed Sheets │ │       │
│    │  12 items  │ │  8 items   │ │ 15 items   │ │       │
│    └────────────┘ └────────────┘ └────────────┘ │       │
│                                                         │
│                    ● ○ ○ ○                               │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

- **Desktop:** Horizontal scroll / slider with 3 visible cards, 4th peeking
- **Tablet:** 2 visible cards
- **Mobile:** 1 card at a time, swipeable
- Section background: `--color-linen`
- Cards: large (width 350px, height 420px), rounded corners `--radius-lg`

**Collection Card:**
- Full-bleed lifestyle image with gradient overlay at bottom
- Category name in Playfair Display, 28px, white, over image
- Item count in Inter, 14px, white 80% opacity
- Entire card is clickable

**Animations:**
| Element | Trigger | Animation |
|---|---|---|
| Section heading | Scroll into view | Fade up |
| Cards | Scroll into view | Slide in from right, staggered 0.2s |
| Card | Hover | Overlay darkens, text moves up 8px, "Shop Now →" fades in below |
| Slider | Drag/buttons | Smooth CSS scroll-snap with `scroll-behavior: smooth` |
| Navigation dots | Active | Scale up + color fill (gold) |
| Arrow buttons | Hover | Circle border appears, scale(1.1) |

**Categories:**
1. **Towels** — Face towels, hand towels, body/bath towels
2. **Bathrobes** — Waffle weave, terry cloth, hooded
3. **Bed Sheets** — Fitted, flat, sets, various thread counts
4. **Pillow Covers** — Standard, decorative, euro shams
5. **Gift Sets** — Curated bundles

