- **Desktop:** 2-column grid (50/50), image left, text right
- **Mobile:** Stacked — image on top, text below
- Section background: `--color-cream`
- Stats bar: 3-column flex, centered below content

**Text Content Suggestions:**
- Headline: "Woven with Care, Made for You"
- Story about sourcing premium cotton, artisan craftsmanship, family tradition
- Values: sustainability, quality, comfort

**Animations:**
| Element | Trigger | Animation |
|---|---|---|
| Image | Scroll into view | Slide in from left + fade, 0.8s |
| Title & text | Scroll into view | Slide in from right + fade, 0.8s, 0.2s delay |
| Decorative gold line (below heading) | Scroll into view | Width grows 0 → 60px, 0.6s |
| Stats numbers | Scroll into view | Count-up animation (0 → target number), 2s |
| Stats items | Scroll into view | Staggered fade up, 0.15s between each |
| "Learn More" button | Hover | Background fill from left (wipe effect), teal |

