**Animations:**
| Element | Trigger | Animation |
|---|---|---|
| Section | Scroll into view | Fade up, 0.8s |
| Heading | Scroll into view | Fade up, 0.3s delay |
| Input + button | Scroll into view | Fade up, 0.5s delay |
| Submit button | Hover | Scale(1.03), shadow increase, bg darken |
| Submit button | Click | Shrink → spinner → expand to checkmark |
| Privacy text | Scroll into view | Fade in, 0.8s delay |
| Background | — | Subtle floating shapes / soft gradient animation |

**Typography:**
- Heading: Playfair Display, 36px, `--color-charcoal`
- Subtext: Inter, 17px, `--color-charcoal` 80% opacity
- Privacy: Inter, 13px, `--color-warm-grey`

