## 3. Global Animations & Interactions

### Scroll Animations (Intersection Observer)
```
{
  "trigger": "element enters viewport",
  "threshold": 0.15,
  "defaultAnimation": "fadeUp",
  "fadeUp": {
    "from": { "opacity": 0, "translateY": "30px" },
    "to": { "opacity": 1, "translateY": "0" },
    "duration": "0.8s",
    "easing": "cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)"
  },
  "fadeIn": {
    "from": { "opacity": 0 },
    "to": { "opacity": 1 },
    "duration": "0.6s"
  },
  "slideFromLeft": {
    "from": { "opacity": 0, "translateX": "-40px" },
    "to": { "opacity": 1, "translateX": "0" },
    "duration": "0.8s"
  },
  "slideFromRight": {
    "from": { "opacity": 0, "translateX": "40px" },
    "to": { "opacity": 1, "translateX": "0" },
    "duration": "0.8s"
  },
  "staggerChildren": {
    "delayBetween": "0.15s"
  }
}
```

### Smooth Scroll
```
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
```

### Page Load
- Navbar fades in (0.5s)
- Hero content animates in sequence (0.3s stagger)
- Preloader: optional — simple fade-out white overlay

### Button Micro-interactions
```
{
  "primaryButton": {
    "rest": { "bg": "--color-teal", "color": "white", "shadow": "--shadow-sm" },
    "hover": { "bg": "--color-teal-dark", "scale": 1.02, "shadow": "--shadow-md" },
    "active": { "scale": 0.98 },
    "transition": "all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)"
  },
  "secondaryButton": {
    "rest": { "bg": "transparent", "border": "2px solid --color-teal", "color": "--color-teal" },
    "hover": { "bg": "--color-teal", "color": "white" },
    "transition": "all 0.3s ease"
  },
  "ghostButton": {
    "rest": { "bg": "transparent", "color": "--color-charcoal" },
    "hover": { "color": "--color-teal", "textDecoration": "underline" }
  }
}
```

### Cursor
- Default on text
- Pointer on all interactive elements
- Optional: custom cursor trail for luxury feel (subtle, not distracting)

---

## 4. Responsive Breakpoints

| Breakpoint | Width | Columns | Container Max-Width |
|---|---|---|---|
| Mobile | < 640px | 1 | 100% (padding 20px) |
| Tablet | 640–1024px | 2 | 720px |
| Desktop | 1024–1440px | 3–4 | 1200px |
| Wide | > 1440px | 4 | 1400px |

