## 6. Complete AI Image Prompts Summary

| Section | Prompt |
|---|---|
| **Hero** | A luxurious king-size bed with crisp white cotton bed sheets and plush pillows arranged artfully. A folded soft ivory bathrobe draped over the corner. Warm ambient lighting from a bedside lamp casting golden tones. Modern minimalist bedroom with neutral cream walls and light wood furniture. Soft morning light streaming through sheer curtains. Shot from elevated angle. Ultra high resolution, 16:9 aspect ratio, editorial photography style, depth of field. |
| **Product: Towels** | A neatly folded stack of premium Egyptian cotton towels in soft white and light grey on a clean white background. Crisp product photography, studio lighting with soft shadows. Plush textured weave visible. Small eucalyptus sprig for accent. High resolution, 1:1 crop. |
| **Product: Bathrobe** | A luxurious waffle-weave bathrobe in soft cream color on a minimal wooden hanger against clean white background. Shawl collar and matching belt tied neatly. Soft studio lighting. 4:5 aspect ratio. |
| **Product: Bed Sheets** | Premium 400-thread-count cotton bed sheet set folded and stacked on white background. Soft ivory and light sage green. Visible sateen sheen. Subtle ribbon tied around set. 4:5 aspect ratio. |
| **Product: Pillow Covers** | Set of decorative cotton pillow covers — one solid blush pink, one subtle geometric in cream and gold. Arranged overlapping on white background. Crisp product photography. 4:5 aspect ratio. |
| **Collection: Towels** | Modern spa-like bathroom with neatly rolled premium white and sage green towels on wooden shelf. Soft natural light. Small potted plant and ceramic soap dispenser. Lifestyle photography, 3:4 aspect ratio. |
| **Collection: Bathrobes** | Person in luxurious cream terry cloth bathrobe standing by large window in modern hotel room. Morning light. Holding coffee mug, relaxed. Lifestyle editorial, 3:4 aspect ratio. |
| **Collection: Bed Sheets** | Beautifully made bed with layered bedding — white fitted sheet, soft blue flat folded down, cream duvet. Multiple plush pillows. Morning sunlight. Lifestyle photography, 3:4 aspect ratio. |
| **Collection: Pillow Covers** | Decorative pillow covers on light linen sofa. Mix of solid colors (blush, sage, cream) and subtle patterns. Natural light, styled with throw blanket. Cozy editorial, 3:4 aspect ratio. |
| **About Us** | Close-up of skilled hands carefully folding premium white cotton towels on rustic wooden table. Warm natural light. Cotton bolls scattered artistically. Shallow depth of field. Warm artisanal atmosphere. 3:4 aspect ratio. |
| **Testimonials BG** | Soft-focus cozy unmade bed with rumpled white sheets, hand gently touching fabric. Warm golden morning light. Dreamy, peaceful, intimate. Muted warm tones. 16:9 aspect ratio. |

---

## 7. Technology Recommendations

| Concern | Recommendation |
|---|---|
| **Framework** | Vanilla HTML/CSS/JS for landing page, or Vite + React for component reuse |
| **Animations** | CSS `@keyframes` + Intersection Observer for scroll reveals; optionally GSAP or Framer Motion if using React |
| **Slider** | Swiper.js or native CSS scroll-snap |
| **Icons** | Lucide Icons or Phosphor Icons |
| **Images** | WebP format, lazy-loaded with `loading="lazy"`, responsive `srcset` |
| **Fonts** | Google Fonts (Playfair Display + Inter), preconnect for performance |
| **Deployment** | Vercel or Netlify (free tier) |

---

## Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Before building, please confirm:**
> 1. **Brand name:** Is "Cotton Connection" your brand name, or do you have a different one?
> 2. **Framework preference:** Vanilla HTML/CSS/JS or React (Vite)? The plan supports both.
> 3. **E-commerce functionality:** Is this a landing/showcase page only, or do you need working cart/checkout?
> 4. **Image generation:** Should I generate the product/section images now using AI, or will you supply your own?
> 5. **Number of products:** How many products to feature in the "Featured Products" section?

---

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Lighthouse audit (Performance > 90, Accessibility > 95)
- Responsive testing at all breakpoints (320px, 640px, 1024px, 1440px)
- Animation performance check (no janky scroll, 60fps target)

### Manual Verification
- Visual comparison against design spec
- Cross-browser testing (Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge)
- Touch interaction testing on mobile devices
- Color contrast verification (WCAG AA minimum)
